// ==============================================================================
// VerySync (微力同步) 过滤规则 - dnplayer-test 专项目录
// 目标: E:\MCP\OpenCode\dnplayer-test\.verysyncignore (与对端全路径双向同步)
// 策略: 保护 Git 双端同步但排除锁；彻底杜绝自动化运行日志冲突锁(bot_run.log等)；保护CV模板资产
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. Git 多端并发安全保护（保留仓库与提交历史，排除锁与瞬态工作态）
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.git/*.lock
**/.git/index.lock
**/.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
**/.git/TAG_EDITMSG
**/.git/FETCH_HEAD
**/.git/ORIG_HEAD
**/.git/rebase-apply
**/.git/rebase-merge
.git/*.lock
.git/index.lock
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 2. Python 自动化运行日志与冲突文件 (彻底杜绝 bot_run.sync-conflict 再次产生)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)*.log
(?d)*.sync-conflict*
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.py[cod]
(?d)*$py.class
(?d).venv
(?d)venv
(?d).pytest_cache
(?d).coverage
(?d).coverage.*
(?d)htmlcov

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 3. 根目录临时调试截屏 (保护 assets/ 内的CV匹配模板图，仅隔离根目录瞬态诊断截屏)
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)current_screen.png
(?d)emulator_focus.png
(?d)obstacle_roi.png

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 4. 通用现代编辑器单机状态与本地临时文件隔离
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Sublime Text
(?d)*.sublime-workspace

// VS Code / Cursor / Zed / Helix / JetBrains / Visual Studio
(?d).vscode/chrome
(?d).vscode/ipch
(?d).vscode/.browse.*
(?d).vscode/*.log
(?d).cursor/cache
(?d).cursor/state
(?d).zed/settings.local.json
(?d).helix/*.local.toml
(?d).helix/*.log
(?d).idea

// Vim / Neovim / 交换文件 / 临时文本 / Office 锁
(?d)*.swp
(?d)*.swn
(?d)*.swo
(?d)*~
(?d).netrwhist
(?d)~$*
(?d)*.tmp
(?d)*.bak
